    "type": "game",
    "name": "Everybody Herds",
    "steam_appid": 3373440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/c22021b057eae2e0b9e33bc467ef82f3.avif?t=1750176042\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haigh! Everybody Herds is the world's definitive herd-'em-up, giving you the unique opportunity to learn how to herd sheep. Race against the clock, manage flocks of hundreds of sheep with the aid of your trusty shepherd, pick and choose upgrades for both to make your sheep even sheepier, then herd herder than ever before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/72944f2aadae4bc7ac963e0a61b798aa.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/72944f2aadae4bc7ac963e0a61b798aa.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/72944f2aadae4bc7ac963e0a61b798aa.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/a27a41a9736567beb31b3b84c3c47e35.avif?t=1750176042\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a Baaaaad Idea... To let the sheep roam unherded. That cannot do. Herd flocks of sheep, turning a bleating mass of hoof and wool into sheep, with your helpful dog at your side!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/cbea91c27458922ed4cb2f721eb98d4c.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/cbea91c27458922ed4cb2f721eb98d4c.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/cbea91c27458922ed4cb2f721eb98d4c.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herding Hard or Hardly Herding? Engage in timed herding, trying to get as many sheep through increasingly complex levels, completing challenging secondary objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What the Ram? Secondary objectives? That\u2019s right, whether it be a pack of ravenous wolves, a big ball of wool to the rescue, or an armada of UFOs descending to abduct your priceless sheep, each level comes with a mass of secrets!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/f4174f7153da34656d2f58883f5e9dda.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/f4174f7153da34656d2f58883f5e9dda.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/f4174f7153da34656d2f58883f5e9dda.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing Ventured, Mutton Gained: Every level can be replayed and revisited, with hidden challenges and secrets waiting for the right herd to come. Hoof it at your own pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buck the Trends: Even the best shepherd (and their dog) can find room for improvement. Pick and choose upgrades for both to stay ahead of the flock - unless you (and your dog) prefer a challenge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/6362e63401c4673200fcd396aee276ec.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/6362e63401c4673200fcd396aee276ec.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/6362e63401c4673200fcd396aee276ec.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Think you have what it takes to herd sheep in Ireland? You think so? <i>Of course you do</i>, after all, Everybody Herds!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/c22021b057eae2e0b9e33bc467ef82f3.avif?t=1750176042\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haigh! Everybody Herds is the world's definitive herd-'em-up, giving you the unique opportunity to learn how to herd sheep. Race against the clock, manage flocks of hundreds of sheep with the aid of your trusty shepherd, pick and choose upgrades for both to make your sheep even sheepier, then herd herder than ever before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/72944f2aadae4bc7ac963e0a61b798aa.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/72944f2aadae4bc7ac963e0a61b798aa.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/72944f2aadae4bc7ac963e0a61b798aa.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/a27a41a9736567beb31b3b84c3c47e35.avif?t=1750176042\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a Baaaaad Idea... To let the sheep roam unherded. That cannot do. Herd flocks of sheep, turning a bleating mass of hoof and wool into sheep, with your helpful dog at your side!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/cbea91c27458922ed4cb2f721eb98d4c.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/cbea91c27458922ed4cb2f721eb98d4c.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/cbea91c27458922ed4cb2f721eb98d4c.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herding Hard or Hardly Herding? Engage in timed herding, trying to get as many sheep through increasingly complex levels, completing challenging secondary objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What the Ram? Secondary objectives? That\u2019s right, whether it be a pack of ravenous wolves, a big ball of wool to the rescue, or an armada of UFOs descending to abduct your priceless sheep, each level comes with a mass of secrets!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/f4174f7153da34656d2f58883f5e9dda.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/f4174f7153da34656d2f58883f5e9dda.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/f4174f7153da34656d2f58883f5e9dda.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing Ventured, Mutton Gained: Every level can be replayed and revisited, with hidden challenges and secrets waiting for the right herd to come. Hoof it at your own pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buck the Trends: Even the best shepherd (and their dog) can find room for improvement. Pick and choose upgrades for both to stay ahead of the flock - unless you (and your dog) prefer a challenge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/6362e63401c4673200fcd396aee276ec.poster.avif?t=1750176042\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/6362e63401c4673200fcd396aee276ec.webm?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373440/extras/6362e63401c4673200fcd396aee276ec.mp4?t=1750176042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Think you have what it takes to herd sheep in Ireland? You think so? <i>Of course you do</i>, after all, Everybody Herds!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Feeling sheepish? You've goat to try herding - after all, Everybody Herds! Grab your trusty dog, buy the farm in Ireland, then see if you can bring some order to the chaos. Hundreds of sheep await to be herded, corralled, sheared, and otherwise sorted in the definitive herd-'em-up!",
